{"id":"f993a9408cb8e9d4","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-existential-quantifier-sets.md","title":"df-existential-quantifier-on-sets","display":"df-existential-quantifier-on-sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-existential-quantifier-sets","aliases":["16-df-existential-quantifier-sets","16-existential-quantifier-sets"],"display":"df-existential-quantifier-on-sets","depends_on":["[[16-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-existential-quantifier-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-existential-quantifier-sets</span><span>16-existential-quantifier-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-existential-quantifier-on-sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f205978a7c11015b\" href=\"?note=f205978a7c11015b\" title=\"16-df-function\">16-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> (集合函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq I\">\\(X\\subseteq I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)\">\\(\\exists_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)\\)</span> (待定义的存在量词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists_u(X)\n\\coloneqq u[X]\n=\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\exists i\\in X)\\;u(i)=j\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists_u(X)\n\\coloneqq u[X]\n=\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\exists i\\in X)\\;u(i)=j\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_u\">\\(\\exists_u\\)</span> 是逆像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{*}\">\\(u^{*}\\)</span> 的左伴随；完整伴随式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"040fbbfdb52f2389\" href=\"?note=040fbbfdb52f2389\" title=\"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets\">16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"f205978a7c11015b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets","status":"resolved","id":"040fbbfdb52f2389","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\exists_u$ 是逆像 $u^{*}$ 的左伴随；完整伴随式见 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists_u(X)\n\\coloneqq u[X]\n=\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\exists i\\in X)\\;u(i)=j\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists_u","display":false},{"tex":"u^{*}","display":false}],"bytes":752,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-existential-quantifier-sets|df-existential-quantifier-on-sets]]"}],"outgoing":["f205978a7c11015b","040fbbfdb52f2389"]}